# virtual_terminal_server manifest — Uros VT shell supervisor (#365).
#
# The supervisor drives no tty of its own: it only forks ush children,
# each of which claims a free VT console as its ctty via char_server's
# unbound-tty exception (#275.5).  No caps required.

name virtual_terminal_server

# No `required` lines — empty caps_required.
# No `delegatable` lines — empty caps_delegatable.
